---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updated = new Date("2026-06-04");
const dateFormat = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("en-AU", { dateStyle: "long" });
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Policy -- Ben Schembri"
  description="No AI is used to write content, but I do use it to write code."
>
  <article class="ai">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        Last updated <time datetime={updated.toISOString()}
          >{dateFormat.format(updated)}</time
        >
      </p>
      <h1>AI Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        No AI is used to write content, but I do use it to write some code.
      </p>
    </header>

    <h2>Writing</h2>
    <p>
      I don't use AI to generate any of the content. <strong>I write all the posts in my own words</strong> for better or worse.
    </p>
    <p>
      I do use use AI to research, discuss ideas with, and review finished posts for flow, consistency and accuracy. I don't always listen to it or agree with it.
    </p>


    <h2>Code</h2>
    <p>
      I use AI coding tools as part of my workflow, the same way I use search engines, linters and other tools.
    </p>
    <p>
      I don't "vibe code" - it's more like pairing with an over-eager, very knowledgeable junior who can type a lot faster than I can. I take full responsibility for any code I ship, whether it's AI-assisted or not.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions? <a href="/connect">Get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .ai {
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 8vh, 5rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .page-head {
    margin-block-end: 2.5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-system-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-fluid--1);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-caps: all-small-caps;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-block-end: 0.5rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: var(--font-size-fluid-0);
    margin-block-start: 0.25rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-block-start: 2.5em;
    margin-block-end: 0.5em;
  }

  p {
    margin-block-end: 1.25em;
  }

  /* Matches the homepage hero stagger so navigating between pages feels
     continuous. Time-based, so opacity:0 only applies when it will animate. */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .page-head > * {
      opacity: 0;
      animation: rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.21, 0.6, 0.35, 1) both;
    }
    .page-head > :nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 0.1s;
    }
    .page-head > :nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }
    .page-head > :nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.32s;
    }
  }

  @keyframes rise {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(1.25rem);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
